---
params: [name, library: Bool, dependencies: [Dependency]]
---
# <%= name %>

<%- if library -%>
A Kex library.
<%- else -%>
A Kex application.
<%- end -%>

<%- if dependencies.count > 0 -%>
## Dependencies

<%- dependencies.map do |dep| -%>
- `<%= dep.name %>` ~> <%= dep.version %>
<%- end -%>
<%- end -%>
